{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Screams and blood\u2026<br>An execution ground where sorrow never ends\u2026<br>And she was always there.<br>Wearing the joyful smile of a child at a playground\u2026<br>The people whispered behind her back, calling her<br><strong>\u201cthe Blood Princess.\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What follows is her story\u2014 <br>and the memories of the man who wished for her happiness. <br>This is the tale of the last princess of the Kingdom of Farrell.  <br>Please join her on her journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> Game description :  <br>\u2726The game &quot;Princess And Knight&quot; is an Tactical role-playing game that follows a funny and interesting story.  <br>\u2726Play the game and you'll be welcomed by many unique characters and their stories.  <br>\u2726The game has three difficulty levels.  <br>\u2726Test your skills and luck at the difficulty level.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Lack of sociality","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1142560/3c0298027aa84f49b215cc761b46581fac534801.jpg"},{"name":"Barter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1142560/de79724384573170064c2cbdb40e0de21db65a2c.jpg"},{"name":"Runaway","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1142560/60a0ceff5f9effab470f7af5f8647cf7aee3a56b.jpg"},{"name":"The supreme commander","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1142560/78320983e69d2e9edd7d0258c793b4191dcb8159.jpg"},{"name":"Hammering","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1142560/a74dd77bf651b4351bf6ef7983d54a53932961a2.jpg"},{"name":"Superstition","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1142560/79b916c8765d72c98238a14acd3722a28bf41a46.jpg"},{"name":"A jeweler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1